{"4063220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eggbert", "steam_appid": 4063220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll, Crack, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a fragile egg named Eggbert going through a world that seems determined to break you. Your goal? Reach the frying pan at the end of each level without cracking under pressure. Simple enough. Until you actually try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump becomes a gamble and every collision a reminder of how delicate you egg really is. One bad bounce, and you’re sent straight back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de0cbbef4f1a5e63eb732d990a9636e0.poster.avif?t=1771259235\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de0cbbef4f1a5e63eb732d990a9636e0.webm?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de0cbbef4f1a5e63eb732d990a9636e0.mp4?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll roll and splatter your egg through a series of wildly different environments. From bright, playful rooms to surreal ski slopes and farmyards, full of moving platforms and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de3af75a55b1dbfe734f34af1d9bbf4d.poster.avif?t=1771259235\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de3af75a55b1dbfe734f34af1d9bbf4d.webm?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de3af75a55b1dbfe734f34af1d9bbf4d.mp4?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things get too tough, hop into the <strong>Tutorial Mode</strong> to practice. You can drop checkpoints anywhere and focus on mastering tricky sections before facing the full challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/6e9230130a9a5d397afc3c658b514bd4.poster.avif?t=1771259235\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/6e9230130a9a5d397afc3c658b514bd4.webm?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/6e9230130a9a5d397afc3c658b514bd4.mp4?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision platforming</strong> that rewards your timing and patience, as well as pure stubbornness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy restarts:</strong> crack your egg once, and it’s back to the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial Mode with custom checkpoints</strong> for stress-free practice runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 10 unique levels, </strong>each designed to give a tougher time than the last </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Eggbert</i> is about learning through failure. A test of timing and how much you can laugh when everything goes wrong.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep it together long enough to make it to the pan?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll, Crack, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a fragile egg named Eggbert going through a world that seems determined to break you. Your goal? Reach the frying pan at the end of each level without cracking under pressure. Simple enough. Until you actually try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump becomes a gamble and every collision a reminder of how delicate you egg really is. One bad bounce, and you’re sent straight back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de0cbbef4f1a5e63eb732d990a9636e0.poster.avif?t=1771259235\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de0cbbef4f1a5e63eb732d990a9636e0.webm?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de0cbbef4f1a5e63eb732d990a9636e0.mp4?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll roll and splatter your egg through a series of wildly different environments. From bright, playful rooms to surreal ski slopes and farmyards, full of moving platforms and unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de3af75a55b1dbfe734f34af1d9bbf4d.poster.avif?t=1771259235\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de3af75a55b1dbfe734f34af1d9bbf4d.webm?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/de3af75a55b1dbfe734f34af1d9bbf4d.mp4?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things get too tough, hop into the <strong>Tutorial Mode</strong> to practice. You can drop checkpoints anywhere and focus on mastering tricky sections before facing the full challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/6e9230130a9a5d397afc3c658b514bd4.poster.avif?t=1771259235\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/6e9230130a9a5d397afc3c658b514bd4.webm?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063220/extras/6e9230130a9a5d397afc3c658b514bd4.mp4?t=1771259235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision platforming</strong> that rewards your timing and patience, as well as pure stubbornness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy restarts:</strong> crack your egg once, and it’s back to the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial Mode with custom checkpoints</strong> for stress-free practice runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 10 unique levels, </strong>each designed to give a tougher time than the last </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Eggbert</i> is about learning through failure. A test of timing and how much you can laugh when everything goes wrong.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep it together long enough to make it to the pan?</p>", "short_description": "A wobbly egg on a deadly journey, with countless ways to crack. One fall resets everything. Survive Eggbert’s relentless climb to the pan. If your nerves can handle it.", "supported_languages": "